From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:01:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] host: read game profile constants at run time for shared host
 builds

Upstream-Status: fork-only (declined seedds/nxnative#492)
Reason: One host binary runs multiple games in the iPhone shell, so profile constants are read at run time
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#226
---
 dm/games/game.py                            |  37 +++
 dm/gfx/nvn/hle_nvn.c                        |  39 ++-
 dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_capture.h                    |   2 +-
 dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_capture.inc                  |   2 +-
 dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m                        |  19 +-
 dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_rec.h                        |   2 +-
 dm/gfx/tests/t_host_stubs.c                 |   2 +
 dm/host/dm.h                                |   1 +
 dm/host/front_mac.m                         |   8 +-
 dm/host/hle_cheats.c                        |  10 +-
 dm/host/hle_fpslock.c                       |   2 +-
 dm/host/hle_fs.c                            |   8 +-
 dm/host/hle_oe.c                            |  10 +-
 dm/host/hle_os.c                            |   4 +-
 dm/host/hle_profile.c                       | 312 ++++++++++++++++++++
 dm/host/hle_profile.h                       |  48 +++
 dm/host/hle_sdk16.c                         |  17 +-
 dm/host/hle_svc.c                           |  52 ++--
 dm/host/hle_thread.c                        |   2 +-
